.TH LEADER-SETUP 1 "" "Leader" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
leader\-setup \- install Leader's Neovim configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B leader\-setup
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Installs Leader's configuration for the current user (and Neovim 0.11 or newer, when it is missing) through Leader's
own installer: the configuration is fetched into
.IR ~/.local/share/leader ,
linked as
.IR ~/.config/nvim ,
and its plugins and language tools are installed. Run by
.BR leader (1)
on the first launch when there is no Neovim configuration. Safe to run again: it brings everything up to date and
never overwrites someone else's configuration.
.PP
Options go to the installer; see
.B leader\-setup \-\-help
\.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR leader (1)
